rcissism"},{"from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.vulnerable-narcissism-vs-growth","id":"notes.psychology.vulnerable-narcissism-vs-growth","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":11,"offset":1717},"end":{"line":26,"column":51,"offset":1757},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.psychology.neurotic-narcissism"}],"anchors":{"neurotic-narcissism-narcissistic-neuroticism":{"type":"header","text":"Neurotic Narcissism (Narcissistic Neuroticism)","value":"neurotic-narcissism-narcissistic-neuroticism","line":15,"column":0,"depth":1},"core-concept":{"type":"header","text":"Core Concept","value":"core-concept","line":17,"column":0,"depth":2},"the-victim-strategy":{"type":"header","text":"The \"Victim\" Strategy","value":"the-victim-strategy","line":20,"column":0,"depth":2},"manifestations":{"type":"header","text":"Manifestations","value":"manifestations","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2},"risk--mitigation":{"type":"header","text":"Risk & Mitigation","value":"risk--mitigation","line":27,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"k7whujrtxo2tvftwjvbq1jh","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"neurotic-narcissism-narcissistic-neuroticism\">Neurotic Narcissism (Narcissistic Neuroticism)<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#neurotic-narcissism-narcissistic-neuroticism\"></a></h1>\n<h1 id=\"neurotic-narcissism-narcissistic-neuroticism-1\">Neurotic Narcissism (Narcissistic Neuroticism)<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#neurotic-narcissism-narcissistic-neuroticism-1\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"core-concept\">Core Concept<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#core-concept\"></a></h2>\n<p>Neurotik adalah sisi narsistik yang rapuh, penuh rasa malu (<em>shame</em>), mudah terluka, dan sangat bergantung pada validasi eksternal. Ini sangat dekat dengan konsep <em>vulnerable narcissism</em>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"the-victim-strategy\">The \"Victim\" Strategy<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#the-victim-strategy\"></a></h2>\n<p>Berbeda dengan tipe agentik yang tampil sombong, tipe neurotik sering tampil sebagai <strong>korban abadi</strong>. Namun, tetap ada <em>self-centeredness</em>: penderitaannya dijadikan pusat dunia.</p>\n<h2 id=\"manifestations\">Manifestations<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#manifestations\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Pola Komunikasi</strong>: \"Gue paling tersakiti\", \"Dunia nggak adil sama gue\", \"Kalau elo pergi, berarti elo jahat\".</li>\n<li><strong>Dampak Relasi</strong>: Menguras energi orang sekitar karena orang lain dipaksa menjadi regulator emosinya secara terus-menerus.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"risk--mitigation\">Risk &#x26; Mitigation<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#risk--mitigation\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Risiko</strong>: Menggunakan <em>victimhood</em> kronis untuk menghindari tanggung jawab personal.</li>\n<li><strong>Obat Sosial</strong>: Terapi profesional, journaling untuk regulasi emosi, menetapkan ekspektasi yang realistis, dan mendorong tanggung jawab personal.</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Atomic Idea</strong>: Neurotik = narsisme sebagai luka yang menuntut pusat perhatian.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>See also: <a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.trifurcated-model-narcissism\">Trifurcated Model of Narcissism</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">psychology (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">npd (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">neurotic (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.trifurcated-model-narcissism\">Trifurcated Model of Narcissism</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.vulnerable-narcissism-vs-growth\">Vulnerable Narcissism vs Growth Patterns</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"name":"scratch","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd.HHmmss","addBehavior":"asOwnDomain"},"task":{"name":"","dateFormat":"","addBehavior":"childOfCurrent","statusSymbols":{"":" ","wip":"w","done":"x","assigned":"a","moved":"m","blocked":"b","delegated":"l","dropped":"d","pending":"y"},"prioritySymbols":{"H":"high","M":"medium","L":"low"},"todoIntegration":false,"createTaskSelectionType":"selection2link","taskCompleteStatus":["done","x"]},"graph":{"zoomSpeed":1,"createStub":false},"enableAutoCreateOnDefinition":false,"enableXVaultWikiLink":false,"enableRemoteVaultInit":true,"enableUserTags":true,"enableHashTags":true,"workspaceVaultSyncMode":"noCommit","enableAutoFoldFrontmatter":false,"enableEditorDecorations":true,"maxPreviewsCached":10,"maxNoteLength":204800,"seeds":{"dendron.templates":{}},"enableFullHierarchyNoteTitle":false},"preview":{"enableFMTitle":true,"enableNoteTitleForLink":true,"enableFrontmatterTags":true,"enableHashesForFMTags":false,"enablePrettyRefs":true,"enableKatex":true,"automaticallyShowPreview":false},"publishing":{"enableFMTitle":true,"enableNoteTitleForLink":tr